(2201, 'Taman Kyai Langgeng - Tempat Wisata Magelang', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Taman%20Kyai%20Langgeng%20-%20Tempat%20Wisata%20Magelang&query_place_id=ChIJ0UZPZl2Pei4Rg_Fgft8rRsM', 5, 'Rahma Wati', 'https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURZcThLYWNBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xc3462bdf7e60f183!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDYq8KacA%7C%7C?hl=id', 'Tempat nya bagus bisa buat kumpul sama keluarga bermain bareng bareng pokoknya seru deh', 'positif', 2.00, '2026-06-01 15:04:03'),
